// Zed keymap — curated gaps + custom on top of `base_keymap: "VSCode"`.
// Only overrides live here; the FULL binding reference (VS Code defaults + these)
// is the cheat-sheet in docs/zed.md.
//
// Modifier convention: Ctrl / Alt / Shift are app-level (Zed). Super is niri's
// (window manager) and is deliberately never used here — niri grabs most Super
// combos before Zed ever sees them. See docs/zed.md.
[
  {
    "context": "Editor",
    "bindings": {
      // Word count of the selection, else the file (tasks.json). Alt+Shift+W
      // pairs with Zed's Alt+Shift+T (task: spawn); Ctrl+Alt+W is taken by
      // workspace::CloseActiveDock.
      "alt-shift-w": ["task::Spawn", { "task_name": "Word count" }]
    }
  }
]
